  description: "Activate only as Chain Link 2 or higher; apply the following effects,
    depending on the Chain Link number of this card, in sequence (skip over any that
    do not apply). You cannot activate this card if multiple cards/effects with the
    same name are in that Chain.\r\n\u25CF 2+: Excavate the top cards of your Deck,
    equal to the Chain Link number of this card, then place them on the top of your
    Deck in any order.\r\n\u25CF 3+: Send the top card of your Deck to the GY.\r\n\u25CF
    4+: Draw 1 card.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"Surprise Chain\" per turn."
